\description{
\code{step_o2pls()} creates a \emph{specification} of a recipe step that removes
\code{num_comp} outcome-orthogonal components from the selected predictors
with \code{\link[=o2pls]{o2pls()}}. Unlike the other orthogonalization steps, the filter can
